      "id": "node-cop02-track-recorder",
      "label": "Track Recorder",
      "type": "component",
      "engineId": "eng-cop-vehicle-tracks",
      "description": "Records vehicle position history into time-ordered track segments for each active vehicle. Ingests real-time position updates from the Vehicle State Store, applies configurable recording parameters (sampling interval, minimum distance threshold), manages track segment lifecycle (start, pause, resume, close), and persists completed segments to the Track Store. Supports track control commands from the COP Orchestrator.",
