      "type": "component",
      "engineId": "eng-cop-vehicle-tracks",
      "description": "Renders vehicle track history as styled polyline overlays on the operational picture. Loads historical track segments from the Track Store and receives live track updates from the Track Recorder. Applies configurable track styling including color per vehicle, line width, opacity fade by age, and time-range filtering. Outputs the composed track layer to the Map Renderer for compositing.",
